<tr><td><a href="/how-it-works/">Cortisol+</a></td><td>A weighted wellness score using available HRV, sleep, heart rate and activity-related factors</td><td>Input availability, baseline assumptions and subscription analysis access</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="https://help.welltory.com/en/articles/4241383-taking-measurements-with-your-apple-watch">Welltory</a></td><td>Supports Apple Watch HRV measurements through its Apple Health connection; not limited to phone-camera measurements</td><td>Measurement method, usable data and the specific features included in the offered plan</td></tr>
